{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/e83f4a1f706c38e7b438588ea2925dc9.avif?t=1760015653\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/630ddf7878bf67ae15216107524220ef.poster.avif?t=1760015653\" width=780 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/630ddf7878bf67ae15216107524220ef.webm?t=1760015653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/630ddf7878bf67ae15216107524220ef.mp4?t=1760015653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master a deck-building card game where strategy, power, and destiny collide.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where all conflict is settled by the divine game of Dobro Goranku, every card you play shapes the future. Build your deck, challenge rivals, and seize control of fate itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World Forged by a Card Game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When endless wars threatened to tear the world of Turiya apart, a God intervened with a single, unbreakable rule: all disputes, from the fate of empires to bitter personal rivalries, would be decided by a sacred card game\u2014Dobro Goranku.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this new era, strategy is your weapon, and the deck is your army. Those who control the cards, control destiny itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/97e64389fb9c3c8f7b98d700ae44842e.poster.avif?t=1760015653\" width=780 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/97e64389fb9c3c8f7b98d700ae44842e.webm?t=1760015653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/97e64389fb9c3c8f7b98d700ae44842e.mp4?t=1760015653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your path to victory starts with strategic deck-building. You must master the six core elements\u2014<strong>Fire, Water, Earth, Air, Light, and Darkness</strong>\u2014to outwit your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/36d3b1473980560c3ff7709c76fa3cc0.poster.avif?t=1760015653\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/36d3b1473980560c3ff7709c76fa3cc0.webm?t=1760015653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/36d3b1473980560c3ff7709c76fa3cc0.mp4?t=1760015653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round is governed by a random element. If your card matches the active element, you secure a guaranteed victory for the turn. But if both players match\u2014or neither do\u2014the true test of power begins. In this scenario, victory goes to the player whose card has the higher stat linked to the round\u2019s governing element.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/ba0b146b6f48a04095f914ecf28bc7e1.poster.avif?t=1760015653\" width=780 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/ba0b146b6f48a04095f914ecf28bc7e1.webm?t=1760015653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evolve Your Power, Claim Your Legacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dobro Goranku is more than just a simple battle. Your cards are a living arsenal designed to evolve. They will level up, gain new stats, and grow immensely more powerful with every duel you win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matches are swift and decisive, concluding in just five rounds. The player who accumulates the most points doesn\u2019t just win\u2014they claim rewards that transcend simple victory, fueling their ongoing progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/d718362b7137e5d5bd9d927551129d84.poster.avif?t=1760015653\" width=780 height=85 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/d718362b7137e5d5bd9d927551129d84.webm?t=1760015653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/c10f93e39aa3bf811ede4ba19a60f9f0.webp?t=1760015653\" width=800 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills against an advanced AI designed to challenge you at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/d4b6d3d27bcd76ad7607220c4a5d4778.webp?t=1760015653\" width=800 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle players from around the world and climb the global leaderboard to prove your strategic mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/4e36d15cda72b558d8bc80fe69eea069.webp?t=1760015653\" width=800 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve your cards, unlock powerful improvements, and constantly customise your deck to perfect your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/211c5146da241a119419ca799955eca6.webp?t=1760015653\" width=800 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the distinct mechanics and synergies of Fire, Water, Earth, Air, Light, and Darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/fbb711372a56c1f0dce19e1c0dfd095a.webp?t=1760015653\" width=800 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into quick, engaging battles that are easy to learn but offer deep strategic challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/7e82f7eae224df36937fa4a8f533ca8b.poster.avif?t=1760015653\" width=780 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/7e82f7eae224df36937fa4a8f533ca8b.webm?t=1760015653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/7e82f7eae224df36937fa4a8f533ca8b.mp4?t=1760015653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dobro Goranku is the ultimate experience for:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of competitive TCGs and turn-based strategy games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who love the deep satisfaction of deck-building, climbing leaderboards, and perfecting their personal strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone seeking a competitive game with simple, fun, and highly engaging mechanics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/d1241b6a42bb362909efc9495ba814a1.poster.avif?t=1760015653\" width=780 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/d1241b6a42bb362909efc9495ba814a1.webm?t=1760015653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dobro Goranku will be available in multiple languages, including English, Portuguese, and Spanish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3898000?t=1760015653","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/2d389ea1e02df5e4f461fd11636a29771d8d868b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760015653","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/c99b2910ee6366f85b6c87172090cc30e7608a2c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760015653","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/c99b2910ee6366f85b6c87172090cc30e7608a2c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760015653","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Lootbox"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/e83f4a1f706c38e7b438588ea2925dc9.avif?t=1760015653\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/630ddf7878bf67ae15216107524220ef.poster.avif?t=1760015653\" width=780 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/630ddf7878bf67ae15216107524220ef.webm?t=1760015653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/630ddf7878bf67ae15216107524220ef.mp4?t=1760015653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master a deck-building card game where strategy, power, and destiny collide.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where all conflict is settled by the divine game of Dobro Goranku, every card you play shapes the future. Build your deck, challenge rivals, and seize control of fate itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World Forged by a Card Game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When endless wars threatened to tear the world of Turiya apart, a God intervened with a single, unbreakable rule: all disputes, from the fate of empires to bitter personal rivalries, would be decided by a sacred card game\u2014Dobro Goranku.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this new era, strategy is your weapon, and the deck is your army. Those who control the cards, control destiny itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/97e64389fb9c3c8f7b98d700ae44842e.poster.avif?t=1760015653\" width=780 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/97e64389fb9c3c8f7b98d700ae44842e.webm?t=1760015653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/97e64389fb9c3c8f7b98d700ae44842e.mp4?t=1760015653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your path to victory starts with strategic deck-building. You must master the six core elements\u2014<strong>Fire, Water, Earth, Air, Light, and Darkness</strong>\u2014to outwit your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/36d3b1473980560c3ff7709c76fa3cc0.poster.avif?t=1760015653\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/36d3b1473980560c3ff7709c76fa3cc0.webm?t=1760015653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/36d3b1473980560c3ff7709c76fa3cc0.mp4?t=1760015653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round is governed by a random element. If your card matches the active element, you secure a guaranteed victory for the turn. But if both players match\u2014or neither do\u2014the true test of power begins. In this scenario, victory goes to the player whose card has the higher stat linked to the round\u2019s governing element.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/ba0b146b6f48a04095f914ecf28bc7e1.poster.avif?t=1760015653\" width=780 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/ba0b146b6f48a04095f914ecf28bc7e1.webm?t=1760015653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evolve Your Power, Claim Your Legacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dobro Goranku is more than just a simple battle. Your cards are a living arsenal designed to evolve. They will level up, gain new stats, and grow immensely more powerful with every duel you win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matches are swift and decisive, concluding in just five rounds. The player who accumulates the most points doesn\u2019t just win\u2014they claim rewards that transcend simple victory, fueling their ongoing progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/d718362b7137e5d5bd9d927551129d84.poster.avif?t=1760015653\" width=780 height=85 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/d718362b7137e5d5bd9d927551129d84.webm?t=1760015653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/c10f93e39aa3bf811ede4ba19a60f9f0.webp?t=1760015653\" width=800 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills against an advanced AI designed to challenge you at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/d4b6d3d27bcd76ad7607220c4a5d4778.webp?t=1760015653\" width=800 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle players from around the world and climb the global leaderboard to prove your strategic mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/4e36d15cda72b558d8bc80fe69eea069.webp?t=1760015653\" width=800 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve your cards, unlock powerful improvements, and constantly customise your deck to perfect your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/211c5146da241a119419ca799955eca6.webp?t=1760015653\" width=800 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the distinct mechanics and synergies of Fire, Water, Earth, Air, Light, and Darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/fbb711372a56c1f0dce19e1c0dfd095a.webp?t=1760015653\" width=800 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into quick, engaging battles that are easy to learn but offer deep strategic challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/7e82f7eae224df36937fa4a8f533ca8b.poster.avif?t=1760015653\" width=780 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898000/extras/7e82f7eae224df36937f